applicable_instruction(I) :- o, instruction(I), instruction_source(I, (system;developer;user)).   % [T] m0079
applicable_instruction(I) :- o, instruction(I), instruction_source(I, (system;developer;user)), not conflicts_with_higher_authority(I), not conflicts_with_later_same_authority(I).   % [T] m0079

